## **Create Tenant API Checklist**

* [ ] validate request body
* [ ] check ownerId exists
* [ ] check owner is active
* [ ] normalize tenant name
* [ ] check same tenant name exists or not
* [ ] start transaction
* [ ] create tenant
* [ ] create tenantUser entry
* [ ] create tenantOwnership entry
* [ ] commit transaction
* [ ] create audit log
* [ ] return tenant response

---

# **List Tenants API Checklist**

* [ ] validate query params
* [ ] apply page/limit defaults
* [ ] calculate skip
* [ ] filter only current user tenants
* [ ] exclude removed memberships
* [ ] apply search filter
* [ ] apply active filter
* [ ] fetch tenants
* [ ] fetch total count
* [ ] include owner details
* [ ] include membership role/status
* [ ] flatten role + membershipStatus
* [ ] calculate totalPages
* [ ] return paginated response

---

# **Get My Tenants API Checklist**

* [ ] validate authenticated user
* [ ] extract current user id from auth
* [ ] fetch all tenant memberships for current user
* [ ] exclude memberships with status `REMOVED`
* [ ] include tenant details
* [ ] include tenant owner details
* [ ] sort by latest joined tenants first
* [ ] optionally flatten response if needed
* [ ] return user tenant list

---


